# Trivy IaC findings we intentionally allow.
#
# Format: one check ID per line (e.g. AVD-AWS-0040). Lines starting with # are
# comments. Every entry MUST carry a comment above it that says:
#   - what the finding is,
#   - why it is accepted here (design decision, compensating control),
#   - where the decision is documented, and
#   - the follow-up that would let you drop the entry, if any.
#
# Prefer an inline `#trivy:ignore:<ID>` on the one resource over a repo-wide
# entry here: a line in this file silences the check in every root.
#
# Example:
#
# # Internet-facing load balancer (`internal = false`). Required by design for
# # the public ingress NLB; the listener only forwards TLS. See
# # aws/accounts/production/eu-west-1/02-platform/nlb.tf.
# AVD-AWS-0053
